    "annotation": "Snapper Rocks peaks at 39% modelled surfable hours in April; Mystics remains more consistent across the year.",

    "analysis": "Monthly modelled surfability differs across Snapper Rocks, Mystics and the Bilinga area. Snapper reaches its highest estimated surfable share in April (39%), Mystics reaches 28% in February and April, and Bilinga peaks in March (35%). These measurements show seasonal patterns, not explanations of user-review ratings.",

    "source": {
      "label": "SaltyBed – Neptune 1.3 monthly surfability model",
      "url": "https://www.saltybed.com/"
    }
